THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
======================

This project links against or embeds the following third-party components,
each governed by its own license (see the notes below; the emulator cores
themselves are downloaded at runtime from the official libretro buildbot or
built from their upstream sources):

- stb (stb_image, stb_truetype, stb_image_write) — Public Domain / MIT
  https://github.com/nothings/stb
- nlohmann/json (v3.11.3) — MIT
  https://github.com/nlohmann/json
- SDL2 — zlib license
  https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL
- libretro API headers — MIT
  https://github.com/libretro/libretro-common
- Noto Sans SC fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-cjk

Runtime components (not bundled in source form):
- FCEUmm (GPLv2), snes9x (non-commercial), mGBA (MPL-2.0),
  Geargrafx (GPLv2), FBNeo (non-commercial), DOSBox-Pure (GPLv2),
  Genesis-Plus-GX (GPLv2), melonDS (GPLv3), PCSX-ReARMed (GPLv2),
  PCSX2 (GPLv3), Flycast (GPLv2), PPSSPP (GPLv2),
  Azahar (GPLv2+), SquirrelJME (GPLv3)
  — all © their respective authors, distributed by the libretro buildbot.
- Dolphin (GPLv2+) © Dolphin Emulator contributors
- Cemu (MPL-2.0) © Cemu contributors
- Eden (GPLv3) © Eden contributors

BIOS / KEY FILES: this repository does NOT contain any BIOS, key or firmware
files. Users must only use files extracted from their own legally-owned
devices; redistributing such files is copyright infringement.
